---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
interface Props { lang?: 'en' | 'vi' }
const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const L = (en: string, vi: string) => (lang === 'vi' ? vi : en);
const W = 900;
const H = 320;
---
<figure class="dcp">
  <div class="dcp-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label={L("Two ways to carry a call. A telephone circuit reserves a slot in every frame, so delay is bounded but silent slots are wasted. A packet network shares one link, so a burst of packets queues in the switch and delay is unbounded.", "Hai cách chuyển cuộc gọi. Mạch điện thoại giữ một khe trong mỗi khung nên độ trễ có trần nhưng khe im lặng bị phí. Mạng chuyển gói dùng chung một đường nên đợt dồn gói xếp hàng ở switch và độ trễ không có trần.")}>
<text x="20" y="24" class="t-h">{L("Telephone circuit: slots reserved for you, so delay is bounded","Mạch điện thoại: khe được giữ riêng cho bạn, nên độ trễ có trần")}</text>
<DiagramIcon name="phone" x={44} y={86} size={28} />
<DiagramIcon name="phone" x={868} y={86} size={28} />
<rect x="100" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-g" />
<text x="128" y="91" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">{L("you","bạn")}</text>
<rect x="160" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<rect x="220" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<rect x="280" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<rect x="340" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-g" />
<text x="368" y="91" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">{L("you","bạn")}</text>
<rect x="400" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<rect x="460" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<rect x="520" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<rect x="580" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-g" />
<text x="608" y="91" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">{L("you","bạn")}</text>
<rect x="640" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<rect x="700" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<rect x="760" y="66" width="56" height="40" rx="4" class="box-d" />
<text x="100" y="128" class="t-m">{L("One frame (250 microseconds) = 4 slots in this sketch. Your slot comes round in every frame.","Một khung (250 micro-giây) = 4 khe trong hình minh họa. Khe của bạn quay lại ở mọi khung.")}</text>
<text x="100" y="146" class="t-m">{L("When you are silent your slot stays empty, so capacity is wasted.","Khi bạn im lặng, khe đó vẫn để trống, nên phí băng thông.")}</text>
<text x="20" y="186" class="t-h">{L("Packet network: everyone shares the link, so packets queue","Mạng chuyển gói: mọi người dùng chung đường, nên gói phải xếp hàng")}</text>
<DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={48} y={224} size={26} />
<path d="M 70 224 L 218.1 247.1" class="ln" /><polygon points="224,248 216.3,250.3 217.4,243.5" class="hd" />
<DiagramIcon name="phone" x={48} y={264} size={26} />
<path d="M 70 264 L 218.0 262.1" class="ln" /><polygon points="224,262 216.8,265.6 216.8,258.6" class="hd" />
<DiagramIcon name="server" x={48} y={304} size={26} />
<path d="M 70 304 L 218.1 277.1" class="ln" /><polygon points="224,276 217.5,280.7 216.3,273.9" class="hd" />
<rect x="230" y="222" width="120" height="80" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="network" x={290} y={250} size={30} />
<text x="290" y="288" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">{L("Switch","Switch")}</text>
<text x="372" y="230" class="t-m">{L("Packets waiting in the queue","Gói đang chờ trong hàng đợi")}</text>
<rect x="372" y="240" width="28" height="26" rx="3" class="box" />
<rect x="406" y="240" width="28" height="26" rx="3" class="box" />
<rect x="440" y="240" width="28" height="26" rx="3" class="box" />
<rect x="474" y="240" width="28" height="26" rx="3" class="box" />
<rect x="508" y="240" width="28" height="26" rx="3" class="box-r" />
<rect x="542" y="240" width="28" height="26" rx="3" class="box-r" />
<rect x="576" y="240" width="28" height="26" rx="3" class="box-r" />
<rect x="610" y="240" width="28" height="26" rx="3" class="box-r" />
<path d="M 650 253 L 824.0 253.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="830,253 822.8,256.5 822.8,249.5" class="hd" />
<DiagramIcon name="server" x={862} y={253} size={28} />
<text x="372" y="292" class="t-r">{L("A burst makes the queue grow, so delay is not bounded.","Một đợt dồn gói làm hàng đợi dài ra, nên độ trễ không có trần.")}</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>{L("Reserving capacity buys predictable delay; sharing it buys low cost per byte. Data centers chose sharing.", "Giữ riêng băng thông đổi lấy độ trễ dự đoán được; dùng chung đổi lấy chi phí mỗi byte thấp. Data center chọn dùng chung.")}</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dcp { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dcp-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dcp svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dcp text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .dcp .t-h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dcp .t-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dcp .t-r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .dcp .t-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .dcp .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dcp .box-r { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dcp .box-g { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dcp .box-d { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dcp .box-gd { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .dcp .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dcp .ln-r { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dcp .ln-g { fill: none; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dcp .ln-d { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dcp .ln-rd { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dcp .ln-gr { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; }
  .dcp .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dcp .hd-r { fill: var(--red); }
  .dcp .hd-g { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .dcp .dot-g { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .dcp figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
